Subject: [PATCH] Resistance Prophet S3: audit, evidence reconstruction,
 clinical-proof program, candidate v0.2.0

From-source audit and reconstruction of the S3 (Macintyre 2018 signature 3,
diagnosis timepoint) platinum-resistance signal in BriTROC-1, with the
versioned research candidate behind ZETA_S3_RESEARCH_ENABLED shadow scoring.

Deliverables (50 files, SHA256SUMS verified):
- Architecture map + contradiction register (17 rows, C01-C17) across branches
- From-source reproduction: n=98 primary (protective AUROC 0.7285
  [0.5942, 0.8468]); 0.8807 shown algebraically identical to 1-AUROC(raw)
- ENDPOINT_CONTRACT v1.0.0 (binary pt_sensitivity_at_reg; never s3_diag<0.10)
- Candidate spec v0.2.0: threshold LOCKED at 0.075 (Youden-grid optimum on
  n=98, inside the 100-fold envelope [0.0502, 0.0798] and bootstrap CI
  [0.0467, 0.2084]); 0.10 permanently REJECTED_AS_LOCK
- Gate E designated decision hardcoded: prioritize s3_diag <= 0.075 patients
  for non-platinum clinical-trial screening (research hypothesis only)
- Gates A-F clinical-proof program + prospective silent-validation protocol
  skeleton (v0.2.0 carries the locked operating point)
- NFE-1 framework crosswalk EXECUTED on TCGA-OV (n=529): s3<->CX3 rho 0.305
  [0.227, 0.382]; criterion NOT MET; CX-cohort validation route CLOSED;
  Gate C route is direct Macintyre s1-s7 quantification
- NFE-3 selection-bias imputation EXECUTED: within-fold MICE on n=98 gives
  delta AUROC 0.1836 [0.1563, 0.2109] (excludes zero); Gate B5 ->
  PASS_WITH_CAVEATS; complete-case 0.3525 was inflated by outcome-selective
  exclusion
- Adversarial suites green: 85 (S3 research) + 116 (colocated) + 43
  (pipeline); backend baseline independently RED (231 failing/erroring
  nodes), zero regressions attributable to this work

Status: RESEARCH USE ONLY. No calibrated-probability claim (Brier skill
-0.2762). No external validation (Gate C BLOCKED). No clinical threshold.
