+
+Operating characteristics at 0.10:
+
+| Set | n | prev | flagged | TP | FP | Sens (CI) | Spec (CI) | PPV (CI) | NPV | Youden J |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 98 | 98 | 0.2041 | 40 | 15 | 25 | 0.750 [0.531, 0.888] | 0.679 [0.570, 0.773] | **0.375 [0.242, 0.530]** | 0.914 | 0.429 |
